        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>方法40 指读（Pointing Reading）</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: #efe9e2;\n    font-family: \"Songti SC\", \"SimSun\", \"Noto Serif CJK SC\", serif;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 540px;\n    min-height: 720px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #f3ede6;\n    padding: 18px 34px 20px 62px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  /* left gutter simulating the facing page edge */\n  .gutter {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 48px;\n    height: 100%;\n    background: #e4dbd1;\n    border-right: 1px solid #cdc2b6;\n  }\n  .running-head {\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: #4a4a4a;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n    margin: 0 0 6px 4px;\n  }\n  .running-head .en {\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    margin-left: 3px;\n  }\n  /* title band */\n  .title-block {\n    background: #111;\n    color: #fff;\n    padding: 4px 10px 10px 10px;\n    margin: 0 0 14px 0;\n  }\n  .title-tag {\n    display: inline-block;\n    border: 1px solid #fff;\n    padding: 2px 12px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    margin: 2px 0 8px 26px;\n  }\n  .title-main {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    padding-left: 4px;\n  }\n  .method-no {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    padding-right: 12px;\n    border-right: 1px solid #fff;\n  }\n  .method-no b { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; }\n  .title-text {\n    font-size: 26px;\n    padding-left: 14px;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .title-text .en {\n    font-family: \"Times New Roman\", Times, serif;\n  }\n  /* side tab on right margin */\n  .side-tab {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 0;\n    top: 178px;\n    width: 46px;\n    padding: 5px 4px;\n    border: 1px solid #333;\n    border-right: none;\n    background: #f3ede6;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    text-align: center;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  /* boxed sub-headings */\n  .box-head {\n    border: 2px solid #f08030;\n    padding: 6px 10px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 26px 0 14px 0;\n    display: block;\n  }\n  p {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    text-indent: 2em;\n    margin: 0 0 12px 0;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  .hl {\n    border-bottom: 3px solid #f5a35c;\n    padding-bottom: 1px;\n  }\n  .flow { overflow: hidden; }\n  .placeholder {\n    float: right;\n    width: 210px;\n    height: 215px;\n    border: 1px dashed #999;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-end;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: #666;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin: 6px 0 6px 14px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    padding-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n  .narrow p { text-indent: 2em; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"gutter\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"running-head\">平读<span class=\"en\">Plain reading</span></div>\n\n  <div class=\"title-block\">\n    <div class=\"title-tag\">用手指来指引读书的方向</div>\n    <div class=\"title-main\">\n      <div class=\"method-no\">方法 <b>40</b></div>\n      <div class=\"title-text\">指读（<span class=\"en\">Pointing&nbsp;Reading</span>）</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"side-tab\">方法4[?]</div>\n\n  <div class=\"box-head\">①用手指或是笔尖指着当前读到的位置</div>\n\n  <p><span class=\"hl\">视线聚焦在手指或笔尖。</span></p>\n\n  <div class=\"box-head\">②沿着阅读的方向移动手指或笔尖</div>\n\n  <p><span class=\"hl\">一边往下读，一边移动手指或笔尖。此时视线依然聚焦在手指或笔尖。手指（或笔尖）的移动速度与我们阅读的速度相同。这样一来，我们的阅读速度会受到手指（或笔尖）移动速度的制约，但是可以保证不会出现倒退或是看错行的情况。</span></p>\n\n  <div class=\"flow\">\n    <figure class